{"version":1,"content":"<p>被捧為叱咤女歌手金獎大熱門的泳兒（Vincy），今日（2日）乘勢推出全新歌曲《旁邊》，邀得林家謙作曲，原來當初Vincy只是給了對方一張雲加梯的照片，然後便成事。</p><p>Vincy笑言入行20年，經驗多了、負擔亦多了，今次特意找家謙寫一首輕盈的歌，幫自己尋回純粹感覺。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:23.167745+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:57:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.658980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:27.788213+00:00","content_hash":"5cdadb5c57a078a17d3ca3d148c0405af666837e7ee8ef7f3cc78df2eaf58e48","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}